# Pokretanje: F5 u Visual Studiu ili `dotnet run` (profil iz Properties/launchSettings.json)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100

### Health: 200 {"status":"OK"}
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Okruženje Development: 200 "Order confirmed", konzola: SMS: Order confirmed
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/confirm

### Scoped InstanceMarker: Same = true unutar zahteva
GET {{baseUrl}}/di/lifetime

### Endpoint bez middleware logova dok ne uradiš zadatak A
GET {{baseUrl}}/pipeline-demo
